		(property "Description" "NPN bipolar junction transistor, numeric pin numbers matching real footprint pads (name B/C/E retained for pinfn netchecks) -- B=pad1, C=pad2 (tab), E=pad3 per industry-standard SOT-89 3-pin numbering convention (tab=Collector confirmed directly by Diodes FCX493 datasheet DS33056 Rev.8-2 footnote 7, 'exposed collector pad'; B-pin1/E-pin3 outer-lead order per standard SOT-89 BJT numbering used across Rohm/Diodes/ON Semi SOT-89 lines, e.g. Rohm 2SA1661 '1.Base 2.Collector 3.Emitter') -- used for Q24/Q25 (SOT-89-3). FLAG: FCX493's own datasheet drawing labels leads by letter only (B/C/E), not by number; B-vs-E outer-pin order is the documented industry convention, not an FCX493-specific numbered table -- verify against physical part/reel marking before fab lock if tolerance to a B/E swap is zero."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
