	(text "Note (mcu Fix 5b, review pass): D16 glows faintly (~75uA through R38+R85+R86 whenever PoE is present) -- D16 is on +12V_POE, NOT on the killable LED_PWR rail, so it is unkillable by SW2/GP9. This is expected/accepted, not a defect."
